# NFOUZ — Unity + Node/Express repository .gitignore
# Build Recovery Phase — excludes generated/local/secret artifacts only.
# Assets, .meta files, Packages/manifest.json, Packages/packages-lock.json,
# ProjectSettings, backend source, migrations, tests, and documentation
# are intentionally NEVER excluded.

## Unity — generated/local only
Library/
Temp/
Obj/
Logs/
UserSettings/
Build/
Builds/
MemoryCaptures/
Recordings/
*.tmp
*.csproj
*.sln
*.user
*.userprefs
.vs/
.idea/
*.apk
*.aab
*.ipa

## Node / backend — generated/local only
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
coverage/
dist/

## Secrets — never commit
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
backend/.env
**/google-services.json
**/GoogleService-Info.plist
**/*firebase*service*account*.json
**/*serviceAccountKey*.json
**/PhotonAppSettings.asset.secret
**/*.pfx
**/*.p12
**/*.keystore
**/*.jks
*.pem
*secret*.json
*credentials*.json

## OS / editor noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
